    },
    {
      "id": "6adfcca40000000000cc8cc5",
      "text": "[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793051813,
      "updated": 1793051814
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfcca50000000000cc8cc7",
      "text": "\t[https://inajob.github.io/moromi-diary/entries/2026-10-26.html 2026-10-26 - モロミの日記]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793051814,
      "updated": 1793051817
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfcca80000000000cc8cc8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793051817,
      "updated": 1793051818
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfcca40000000000cc8cc6",
      "text": "[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793051813,
      "updated": 1793052942
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd10d000000000021e2b9",
      "text": " [うまい棒]って4分割できたんだ",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793052943,
      "updated": 1793053014
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd143000000000021e2bb",
      "text": "  [うまい棒をうまく4つに割る自由研究]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053014,
      "updated": 1793053014
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd14b000000000021e2bc",
      "text": "  もうページまである！",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053014,
      "updated": 1793053016
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd159000000000021e2bd",
      "text": "   結構有名そう",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053020,
      "updated": 1793053030
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd131000000000021e2ba",
      "text": " 友人が中学の時点で自分の意志で[公務員]を志していた、という話を聞いてビビった",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053014,
      "updated": 1793053075
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd18e000000000021e2be",
      "text": "  安定、そこそこの収入、激務のなさを理由に挙げていた",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053071,
      "updated": 1793053103
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd1ae000000000021e2bf",
      "text": "  中学でそこまで現実的な視野を持っている人が友達だった",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053104,
      "updated": 1793053141
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd1c8000000000021e2c0",
      "text": " たった一人でそこそこの生活を送ることは意外とむずいような",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053129,
      "updated": 1793053605
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd208000000000021e2c1",
      "text": "  少なくとも[h45te.icon]にとっては",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053193,
      "updated": 1793053202
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd211000000000021e2c2",
      "text": "  部屋は狭く汚くても平気、寒くても服を着れば結構、暑くても脱げば結構、……",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053202,
      "updated": 1793053246
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd23d000000000021e2c3",
      "text": "   生活水準が床ペロしそう",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053247,
      "updated": 1793053258
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd249000000000021e2c4",
      "text": "  現時点で上の友人のように、自分の欲だけで生きる暮らしを仮定すると、無茶苦茶な生活がまず浮かぶ",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053259,
      "updated": 1793053335
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd29e000000000021e2c5",
      "text": "  多分需要をアウトソーシングすることが床ペロ脱却のカギ",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053344,
      "updated": 1793053381
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd2c4000000000021e2c6",
      "text": "   清潔に思われたい人がいないと髭は剃らない",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053382,
      "updated": 1793053434
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd2f9000000000021e2c7",
      "text": "   家に人が来ないと部屋の[エントロピー]は増大する",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053434,
      "updated": 1793053469
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd38c000000000021e2cb",
      "text": "   それ以外にも人がいる方が役に立ちたい精神が働く場合も",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053605,
      "updated": 1793053623
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd31e000000000021e2c8",
      "text": "  より多く需要を供給してもらう人間関係を構築するために、は",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053472,
      "updated": 1793053737
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd348000000000021e2c9",
      "text": "   [服を買いに行く服がない]みたいな状態を抜けたい",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053605,
      "updated": 1793053605
    },
    {
      "id": "6adfd3b8000000000021e2cc",
      "text": " [ギター]がずっと歪んでると思ったらGAINとVOLUMEのつまみを勘違いしていた",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1793053625,
      "updated": 1793053691
    },
    {
